Subject: [PATCH 0016] Prism: chrome://prism-onboarding 4-step first-run flow

Registers the new onboarding WebUI (src-overlay
chrome/browser/ui/webui/prism_onboarding/) and points the first-run tab at
it (chrome://prism-welcome stays reachable directly and keeps the fixture
chrome.send handlers). The flow: splash -> pitch -> import wizard (drives
the shared staged+live Chrome import extracted to
chrome/browser/prism/prism_chrome_live_import.{h,cc}) -> finish (default
browser, Add to Dock via dock::AddIcon, crash-report consent pref).

Completion is recorded in the Local State pref prism.onboarding_completed
(registered via prism::RegisterLocalStatePrefs from RegisterLocalState) and
guards the first-run tab alongside the first-run sentinel.

Stacking notes: the include hunk and the first-run retarget intentionally
stack on 0009's added lines (apply/revert in series order); all other hunks
anchor on pristine upstream lines.

